                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono dark:text-white/40">CSV → JSON</span>
                </div>
                <pre class="!m-0 !bg-transparent overflow-auto language-php text-sm leading-6 px-5 py-4 flex-1" data-controller="syntax-highlight"><code class="language-php">{{- flowPhpCode | escape('html') -}}</code></pre>
            </div>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-600 text-center dark:text-white/60">
            Swap <code class="font-mono text-violet-700 dark:text-[#d2a8ff]">to_json</code> for
            <code class="font-mono text-violet-700 dark:text-[#d2a8ff]">to_xlsx</code>,
            <code class="font-mono text-violet-700 dark:text-[#d2a8ff]">to_parquet</code>, or
            <code class="font-mono text-violet-700 dark:text-[#d2a8ff]">to_postgres</code> - same shape, different destination.
